Subject: [PATCH] fusion: cache items, install references, assembly names,
 enumerator clones, download cache (3229)

IAssemblyCacheItem streams and commit, FUSION_INSTALL_REFERENCE kept per
assembly with UninstallAssembly dispositions and CreateInstallReferenceEnum,
IAssemblyName SetProperty/Finalize/Clone, IAssemblyEnum::Clone and the
download cache (GetCachePath, ClearDownloadCache).

